# T3: TIMED arm A of the ABAB timed pair of the W1 window: A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate (the control: the eight 262k seats, the nine best levers, the quad blocks, 19,968 blocks, the in-trace sampler), B = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-w1 (the control minus the in-trace sampler plus the drafter ops D2a and D2c, the host-gap stage 1 flags and the unit-major reduce-scatter U1; QWEN_FAST_CCL_TOPOLOGY=ring is NOT in it). Audits off in both arms. Arms alternate A B A B in this one image, each after its own all-four reset.
# The tests: warmup, one coding stream, concurrent8_steady (the quad blocks' mix: the smoke rule needs it), eight 32k code users and eight about 120,000-token users, eight live at once.
# READ: the [PACKED-PHASE] round times of the eight-user tests, PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians (check the load average around the run: no build, no CI push and no other job beside it), the per-seat rate, the texts equal
# between the arms, and on B: the [PACKED-PRESTAGE] paths (path=diff on at least 95% of both blocks' 4+4 rounds), [PACKED-HOSTGAP-WINDOW], and the lever lines. Then offline: python scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py <A results> <B results>
# --users 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0 identical). W1's projection is a 32k round of about 182 ms against 222 ms today (the planning ladder; the delivered per-lever gains come from P1, not from this pair).
# Duration (estimate): 90 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/w1 eight-seat 262k stack window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/w1 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w1-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/w1 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-w1-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-time-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k
